        "text": "AI SCENE BUILDER - CONVERSATIONAL PASSES\n\nType an instruction, queue, look at the render, type the next instruction, queue again.\nThe session .blend is the memory: 'add a bridge over the river', 'make the towers taller',\n'add fog lights along the path'. Each pass sees the current scene (objects, sizes, materials).\nKeep the same session_name. Use 'reset' once to start a fresh scene.\n\nSECURITY: the builder executes model-written Python in Blender. No sandbox.\nEvery script is saved to ComfyUI/output/ai_scene_builder/<session>/scripts/ BEFORE it runs.\nSet dry_run=true to review scripts first (then use 'AI Script Runner')."
